    "question": "What debounce time was added to the anti-pinch algorithm after the rough-road problem?",
    "answer": {
      "found": true,
      "answer": "The fix for the rough-road false reversals added a 30 ms debounce before a pinch is confirmed, along with a speed-ripple filter on the motor speed signal. The lessons-learned document also says that any change to the force threshold, the debounce or the motor needs a new check of both false reversals and stop time.",
